---

## Learning Objectives

- Understand different Verilog HDL modeling styles.
- Compare Behavioral, Dataflow, Gate-Level, and Structural implementations.
- Verify combinational logic using simulation.
- Visualize hardware implementation using Vivado Elaborated Design.

